```plaintext
Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```

```turtle
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/autonomousDriving#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

ex:Scene1 a ex:DrivingScene ;
    ex:hasWeatherCondition ex:HeavyFog ;
    ex:hasTimeStamp "2023-10-05T14:30:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime .

ex:Vehicle1 a ex:AutonomousVehicle ;
    ex:hasColor "Red" ;
    ex:hasPosition ex:FrontPosition ;
    ex:isInScene ex:Scene1 ;
    ex:hasSpeed "20"^^xsd:kmPerHour ;
    ex:hasDirection ex:Forward .

ex:Road1 a ex:Road ;
    ex:hasSurfaceCondition ex:Wet ;
    ex:hasMarking ex:Crosswalk ;
    ex:hasVisibility ex:Reduced ;
    ex:isInScene ex:Scene1 .

ex:Building1 a ex:Building ;
    ex:isLocated ex:RightSide ;
    ex:isInScene ex:Scene1 .

ex:StreetLight1 a ex:StreetLight ;
    ex:isInScene ex:Scene1 ;
    ex:hasVisibility ex:Obscured .

ex:Vehicle2 a ex:Vehicle ;
    ex:isOccluded true ;
    ex:isInScene ex:Scene1 ;
    ex:hasDirection ex:Forward .

ex:Vehicle1 ex:isApproaching ex:Crosswalk .
ex:Vehicle1 ex:hasOccludedView ex:Vehicle2 .
ex:Vehicle1 ex:hasReducedVisibilityDueTo ex:HeavyFog .
ex:Vehicle2 ex:isFollowing ex:Vehicle1 .
ex:Building1 ex:isAdjacentTo ex:Road1 .
ex:StreetLight1 ex:isAdjacentTo ex:Road1 .
```

---

```
Identified Risks for each risk class
```

**Risk 1:**
Description:
The autonomous vehicle (Vehicle1) has significantly reduced visibility due to heavy fog, which obscures other vehicles (Vehicle2) and road infrastructure. This increases the risk of collision or failure to detect obstacles in time.

Severity Score: 0.85

**Risk 2:**
Description:
The presence of an occluded vehicle (Vehicle2) behind the autonomous vehicle (Vehicle1) in reduced visibility conditions poses a risk of rear-end collision if Vehicle1 suddenly stops or slows down.

Severity Score: 0.80

**Risk 3:**
Description:
The wet road surface (Road1) combined with reduced visibility increases the risk of hydroplaning or loss of vehicle control, especially if the autonomous vehicle needs to make sudden maneuvers.

Severity Score: 0.75

**Risk 4:**
Description:
The obscured street lights (StreetLight1) further reduce visibility and may lead to incorrect interpretation of the environment by the autonomous vehicle, increasing the risk of misjudging distances and speeds of other entities.

Severity Score: 0.70

**Risk 5:**
Description:
The autonomous vehicle's reliance on sensors and cameras may be compromised by the heavy fog, leading to inaccurate data input and potentially incorrect decision-making.

Severity Score: 0.90

These risks collectively highlight the critical need for enhanced sensor capabilities, robust decision-making algorithms, and contingency plans for extreme weather conditions in autonomous driving systems.